{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011CgS4AU8wZXRVXa9PNeusG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All six events from `docs/EVENTS.md` are now wired into the registration and offers screens through `Analytics.capture`. `flutter analyze` reports no issues. I didn't run the app, so the events haven't been checked against PostHog. Nothing was sent anywhere external.\n\nChanges are in `lib/screens/registration_screen.dart` and `lib/screens/offer_screen.dart`. The write-up is in `ANSWER.md`.\n\n- **`registration_email_started` / `registration_phone_started`**: fire once per visit, on the first character typed. The value itself is never sent.\n- **`loan_amount_changed`**: fires when the slider drag ends, with the final amount. The doc says \"the chosen amount\", so I didn't fire on every tick.\n- **`terms_accepted`**: fires when the box is ticked. Unticking sends nothing.\n- **`registration_continue_tapped`**: fires on tap with `amount` and `terms`. The button is disabled until the form is valid, so it can't fire early.\n- **`offers_scrolled`**: fires when a scroll ends, with the final `offset`. It fires once per scroll, not per frame.\n\nRunning `flutter analyze` also rewrote `analysis_options.yaml` and created `pubspec.lock` and `.dart_tool/`. I reverted the YAML and deleted the two generated items, so only the two screen files and `ANSWER.md` differ from the original commit."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1146,"cache_read_input_tokens":31409,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1146},"output_tokens":4,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8909ff00-7383-437b-9c79-5696c25de2b7","uuid":"11201c7f-b36f-48fa-8dfc-a402d2c4a943